{
  "octatrack": "MKII, OS 1.40C, development base 06e08f35c62c02ce, no CompactFlash card",
  "stimulus": "Recorder 3, 37,800 stereo frames at 24 bits. A16, Part 3 at 100 BPM. All effects cleared, six untriggered THRU machines. Both T1 and T5 point at R3. Grain assigned to one at a time, with 16 trigs on the target. Dense SRC and SETUP are identical across voice limits. SCAN +2 on T1 and -2 on T5.",
  "capture": "The CoreAudio device delivered 20 channels at 44.1 kHz. The meter accumulated energy for all incoming samples and checked the MAIN channels. The guard deltas cover the stream startup, transport, sustained playback and stop. The 12-second MIDI workload sends 13,249 events. In the combined test USB audio, sequencer and MIDI run together. Guard skips count omitted machine renders, not host audio samples.",
  "audition": "Host render of the portable Grain core with the same seed, stereo plucked phrase and gain for every build. Eight seconds at defaults and eight seconds dense. Level in dBFS. The default renders are sample-identical.",
